[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":6},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":2},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰！"},{"op":"background","image":"bg009"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「早上了，朋也。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我尽力遮住直刺而来的阳光，挣扎着直起了身子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「早上好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…早安。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你醒来的模样，还是没半点变化呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「今天可是你久违的学校哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「难道不会感觉很兴奋吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「一点不…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「为什么啊。我们又可以一起度过午休时间了不是吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「因为休息天里我们可是能成天黏在一块儿的啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「上课的时候不得不分开啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我连上课的时间里也想和你在一起。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，这就有点难了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，我很高兴你有这份心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「想起这事来，就算上课时间里也会很幸福。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，这样一来说不定课就听不进去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你还会担心听不进去，而我则是早就放弃听课了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谁让我脑子里尽是你的事情呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，可别想色色的事情了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那得看怎么妄想的。如果真有，麻烦通融通融。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不行。绝对不原谅。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「要是休息的时候我发现你有一点不对劲，后果自负啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那还真是够可怕的。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg016"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"告示板的公告，焕然一新。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一定是选举委员会的人趁着时间还早，换掉了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是传闻也能这么简单就删掉该多好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，现实没有那么简单。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，只能靠我们自己的力量去改变。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg017"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也，午休时不要去买面包了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在分开的时候，智代说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没为什么。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021e"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到了午休时候。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这是庆祝你的回归。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的桌子上并排了两个便当盒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中一个里面塞满了豪华的配菜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而另一个上面，则铺满了五颜六色的肉末烧蛋。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「本来想用肉末烧蛋拼一个你的名字的，但想想实在是太羞人了，所以放弃了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「然后想用爱心来代替，不过这个也够羞人的，所以也没做。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「因此，最后做了小熊的样子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…这也够羞人的了！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不觉得还挺可爱的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你看，和刚起床时候的你一模一样呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「厉害吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原一脸看白痴的样子，非常符合现在的情况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果春原不在这里，只有我和智代两个人的话，我一定溜之大吉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「看来，我不在这比较好呢…再见。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到春原准备站起来走人的时候立刻抓住了他的后领，扯了回来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（等等！别丢下我！不对，给我待这儿！这是命令！）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小声说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"（说实话，我怎么待得下去啊…这可不是第三者可以插足的状况。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（那个小熊就让给你吃好了。）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"（要是吃了那玩意儿的话，我估计会死在智代手下。）"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"周围有几个学生，还夸张地踮起了脚来看我们这桌的样子。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"（比起来和我说悄悄话…快点把证据销毁掉才更聪明不是吗？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（也是…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么了，你们两个？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我开动了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我双手合十，立马就抓起了筷子狼吞虎咽地将小熊给吞了下去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「多谢款待！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"１０秒解决战斗。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「太好吃了。不愧是智代呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「…刚才你吃的，是我的便当。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唉？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是…我的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯。那个不是你的。你的在这里呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代的膝盖上放着另一个便当盒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你早点说嘛…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「谁会想到你１０秒钟就全吃完了啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确实。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「真是拿你没办法呢…怎么办才好呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你吃这盒不就行了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这个要我自己吃的话，稍微有点…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代打开了便当盒。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这里面，有你的名字和一个爱心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哐！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我整个脸直接砸在了桌子上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「再见，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别走啊ーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这是，我对你的思念。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「要是自己吃了的话就太诡异了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「再见了，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别走啊啊啊啊啊啊ーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也…你会吃的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知…知道了啦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「记得要慢慢品尝味道哦？可不要再像刚才那样哦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊，好的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「再见了，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以都说了，别走啊啊ーーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「你们几个啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正在这时，传来了令人不禁打个冷颤的声音。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「之前说了，不要吵了的吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「也好，这样我就能肆无忌惮地出手了呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不不不，你是隔壁班的班长吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我是代替椋…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没错，是替椋…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"昂着头低眼看着智代。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「听说你干架很有一套的样子呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那来堂堂正正地一决胜负吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不管杏再怎么穷凶极恶，空手怎么可能是智代的对手。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",323],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏和智代，两人在走廊上互相正视着对方。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「危，危险了…看来只有我伺机站到她们之间…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「最后绝对是你被那两个人踢飞就是了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不过，这样下去，她们会因为两股力量的冲击而失去记忆吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你啊，还是少看点漫画吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"先动手的是杏。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"迅速近身后挥出了手刀。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但轻轻松松便被卸开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"上面行不通的话就走下面。低身扫腿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而也被轻巧地闪过了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代一味地在防御。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许是因为对方是前辈的关系所以留手了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（不对…除了春原之外，我从来没有看到过她对这所学校的人动过手…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而，杏她…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即便自己的攻击每次都被轻易接下，也没有丝毫放弃的意思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咬紧了牙关…拼尽自己全力…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怎么说呢，并非是愤怒之类的，而更多的是一种无可奈何却又无法言喻的感情宣泄在了智代的身上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不如说，为什么杏会如此的敌视智代呢…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm34"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「差不多，住手吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代放下了用来防御的手臂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而就在此时…"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏的耳光，甩在了她的脸上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「为什么…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…为什么，是你呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「只不过是会打架而已…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm34"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「…来到这所学校之前的我，或许的确是这样吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「但是，今后我会努力的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「无论是什么事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我发过誓了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm34"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「如果说…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你和朋也关系很好的话…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我希望你也能喜欢上我。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以…今天这样的事情，希望是最后一次了。」"},{"op":"choice","id":"2506:5059010","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"不出声交给智代处理","value":0,"serial":5059010},{"text":"开口介入","value":1,"serial":5059020}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":230,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要和智代聊几句，知道她那傻瓜一般正直的性格，是不可能有人会讨厌她的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，我一言不发地看着事态的发展。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就让我…暂时观望下吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「现在，还不知道今后会怎么样…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完这些话后，杏转身离开了这里。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呼…居然就这么结束了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我还以为绝对会是以你被踢飞为收场的呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这件事，和我没有半点关系的吧。」"},{"op":"goto","to":270},{"op":"ifFalse","to":270,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这家伙一旦下定了决心的话，很死脑筋的哦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽然这三天我因为自己犯傻而遭到停学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但不管是我还是春原，依然被盯死了不让我们迟到。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽然说，也有她特地送来的便当这种好事就是了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哼…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是这样的吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不管怎么样，我都会选择正确的路。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「午休吵闹一事，是我不好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「再也不会发生这样的事了。我保证。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以，不要再继续争执了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「下次，一起坐下来吃午饭吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代伸出了自己的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯…所以今后可别再踢我了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原也握住了伸来的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被两个人一齐踢飞了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就让我…暂时观望下吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「现在，还不知道今后会怎么样…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"握住了智代的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊…最凶和最强组一队了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的好吗？冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不挺好的么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要和智代聊几句，知道她那傻瓜一般正直的性格，是不可能有人会讨厌她的。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",223],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":289,"condition":["==",["v","f",221],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样，我们度过了久违的三人午休时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很开心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果时间能就这样持续下去该多好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我打心底里这么希望。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于，到了学生会选举的投票日。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":7},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"bg021"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"投票是在班会里，由每个班级各自举行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是在选票上罗列的名字里画个圈交上去就行了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在智代的名字上画了一个圈。"},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":2508,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样，我们度过了久违的三人午休时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很开心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后，我向两人说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说，你们两个今天放学后有时间吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「今天吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我没问题。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，我也没什么事情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么，稍微陪我一下吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你要干嘛？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「运动。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「突然觉得偶尔出点健全的汗水也挺好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的假的…我可一点都不想出汗呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我没记错的话，你的运动神经还挺好的吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「算是吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，要是带上春原的话，会不会因为实力太强了而没得玩呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「放心吧。我会手下留情的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经完全进入状态了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「智代呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也的邀请，我当然参加…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，今天我没带体操服来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎呀，那还真是遗憾。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你又在想什么色色的事情了吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，没事的。校服就可以了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我觉得这可不怎么好呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「就算是校服，至少下面得穿个短裤什么的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不会选那些要蹦蹦跳跳的运动的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…那样的话，好吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好了，就这么定了。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg030a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",310],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放学后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们三个人来到了操场上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"棒球部正在我们的眼前练习。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「在操场上？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「但你也看到了，已经被棒球部占领了呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没事的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对手就是这些家伙了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「唉？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「等等，朋也。你是什么意思？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无视了智代的发言，我独自走向了站在传令区的棒球部成员。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥，有没有兴趣一决胜负？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"棒球部部员","text":"「哈？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「用棒球一决胜负。对手是那家伙。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「…我吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错。就是你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「等等，不是说我们三个人玩的吗？和刚才说的不一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，你听着就是了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"棒球部部员","text":"「你在开什么玩笑吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和女的玩棒球，带着一脸不屑的棒球部成员们向我们望了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是开玩笑。要是那家伙输了的话，我们就来给你们打杂，比如捡球之类的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「反过来，要是她赢了的话，要答应我们一个条件。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"棒球部部员","text":"「哼…是吗。那还真有意思呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"上钩了。看来是觉得自己被看扁而不爽了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"棒球部部员","text":"「喂，把人都叫来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"男生去召集了其他人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"棒球部部员","text":"「这女的要和我们一决胜负呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"棒球部部员","text":"「看来我们的弱小已经传遍整个学校了吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前说话的男生似乎是棒球部的主将。在他煽动下，所有人的表情都不一样了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「有自愿站出来的人吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怒喝一声后，几个人举起了自己的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你到底在打什么算盘，朋也…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代低声在我耳边说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「抱歉，我可没有战胜这家伙的自信…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「而且要说的话，我可从来没有玩过棒球。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「交给我吧。你只要全力以赴就行了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「话说回来，为什么非要…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「听我的吧，智代。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你是认真的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，认真的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「既然朋也这么说的话，我也不坚持了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那，准备上吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「真的，是认真的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。拜托了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「就这次哦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「如你们所见。对手要多少有多少？所以要怎么决出胜负来？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「智代，投球和击球里面，你比较擅长哪个？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「都不擅长。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「硬要选一个的话，选哪个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没有什么好选的。毕竟我从来都没有玩过。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"人群中又传来了笑声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那就投球吧。用你的全力来投球。比起击球而言不需要太多的技术。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不是那么简单的问题吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这样好了。她来投球，你们来击球。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「三个人。要是三人出局的话就算你们输。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是有一棒安打的话，就算你们赢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「哈哈哈！这还真是有意思呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是愤怒到了极点后，反而笑出声了的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「好，就按你说的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"实际上，如果我不熟悉智代的话也会和他一个样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊，防守借我们几个人。滚地球高飞球什么的接住就行了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「知道了，知道了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像是在安抚小孩子一般的声音说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回头面向其他成员后…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「就按刚才的防守位置。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下达了命令。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「捕手的话还是你们自己解决如何？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对了，还有这茬儿。那就春原。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊。你看，运动神经数你最好不是吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「算是吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那就拜托了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真是的，拿你没办法呢。我就随便玩玩吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是好打发的男人。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"问棒球部借来了捕手手套，坐到了本垒板后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，你不戴护具吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「业余棒球要这种东西干嘛，多难看。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么智代。你先投几个练习一下！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对站在投手席上的智代喊到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这样吗，这么投对不对？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一次又一次的，空手尝试着动作。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那样只用到了手腕在投球，这样，像这样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原站了起来后，教了她正确的姿势。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要活用下半身！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「用手投球，为什么要用到下半身呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「用得到啦！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「吵死了，我要投了哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好啊，来吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原再次坐了下来，拍了一下捕手手套。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代高高举起了双手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「预备ー」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…咣！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所有人都抬头看向了上空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"球重重地砸在了金属栏网的高处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"整个球都埋了进去，丝毫没有要掉下来的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而身后负责防守的球员里则响起了嘘声。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「笨蛋，先想想怎么控球。下次丢轻一点。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘭！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然还有些高，不过总算是面前投进了春原的捕手手套里面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"部员","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到了她投球后的棒球部成员们，一下没有了半点声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（没办法，只看球路的话，这可不是外行人能投出的球呢…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「你们准备好了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「那，裁判由我来担任。没问题吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可别太严格了哦。毕竟我们可是外行人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「行。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",327],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"主将来到了春原身后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「第一棒，谷口！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被点到名字的部员走进了击球区。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「准备了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「来吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"开始投球准备姿势。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰！…咣！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"界外。直飞到了身后的栏网上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「刚才这球是坏球吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「好好看清楚了再打。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「裁判别给建议啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「别吵。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…嘭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"略低。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这是好球吧。毕竟是外行人。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「嗯，是啊…好球！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（春原，你在这种操作上真的是一流…结果自己却那么单纯…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第三球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大暴投。又飞到了后面的栏网上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「冷静点，智代！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"换了新的球来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「吵死了，你安静点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第四球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"球路略高。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…不过击球手忍不住挥了棒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「刚才这个也是坏球吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「对，对不起…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好了，出局的号令呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「嗯，是啊…挥空出局！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好了。智代，干的漂亮！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「被你夸奖了后，不可思议的会让人失去干劲呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我说你，同伴可是在鼓励你啊，你倒是接受这好意啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以说，我早说了从来没有把你看作是同伴啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「虽然嘴上是这么说，像这样互相信任的我们早就已经是伙伴了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你是开玩笑的吧？要是认真的话，你又得飞起来了哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，别害羞嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「真是让人火大的家伙…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「下一个，柳本！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"柳本","text":"「得令！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「给我好好看清楚了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"柳本","text":"「得令！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下一个击球手站到了击球区里。躯干比别人足足大了一圈，看上去就像是队伍主炮的体格。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「智代，只是身体大而已，别在意！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我都说了，不用你插嘴…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，来吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第一球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太低。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「坏球！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么了，智代！你这也算前甲子园投手么！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我才没有那样的过去，今天是第一次投球。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻…咣！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又是太高了，直飞栏网。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「快想起来，智代！那一天，你紧握着球棒降临到这个世上的日子！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那种东西能进到肚子里就见鬼了吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第三球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"全力的投球砸在了地面上。弹了一次后从春原头上飞过。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「呜…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你以后别玩棒球了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「又不是我喜欢才在玩的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第四球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「坏球！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊ー，这孩子到底在干什么啊，受不了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「都是坏球怎么算。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没事。可以有四坏球。如果保送得分了的话，就算你们胜利好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「是啊。不然的话太阳下山都结束不了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「柳本，四坏球保送。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"柳本","text":"「得令！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来由于春原的关系让智代失去了冷静。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（谁让那家伙的煽风点火根本不分敌我呢…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「四坏球保送！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之后，智代没能投出任何一个好球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「四坏球保送！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于，垒上已经站满了跑者。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「满垒了呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「最后，还是我来好了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「谷口，你来当裁判。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"主将亲自站到了击球区。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你要是再投四坏球保送的话，这辈子我都要叫你石毛了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那是谁啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「就是说你跳蚤心！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那我可不要…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代在招呼我过去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「暂停。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一路跑到智代的身边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么，有什么问题吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那家伙实在太让人火大了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我理解。总之先冷静。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「就算要我冷静下来，现在也做不到啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我不想再继续了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「智代…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「并不是说我不想投球什么的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「只是那家伙实在太讨厌了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「总是说些让人不爽的话…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「对了。朋也。你来接球吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我说不出话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为和父亲打架的原因。我的右手没办法抬过肩膀。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以也没有办法把球投回去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果只是接球的话也许能行吧…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但，如果那样的话…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代一定会顾虑我，那样就只会投一些容易接住的球了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而对于打者来说，简直是绝佳的机会。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样真的行得通吗…？"},{"op":"choice","id":"2506:5062160","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"行","value":0,"serial":5062160},{"text":"不行","value":1,"serial":5062170}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":814,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果真是那样的话，那也就到此为止了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"既然没办法和春原搭档投球的话，也只好这样了。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「智代…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我来做捕手…不过你听好了。绝对不要手下留情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这可是挽回你名声的比赛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「等等，我可没听你说过这事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，我也是第一次告诉你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「到底是怎么一回事？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是我，再一次让你成为学校里最受欢迎的人的作战。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这种事情怎么可能获取人气呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可以的。要是你击败了棒球部，这事立刻就会传开。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且，这是公平竞争下的产物。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是打架也不是什么乱七八糟的。这是竞技体育。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「好吧…你说的我理解了…不过，我觉得只是徒劳。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就算是徒劳也好。我想试试看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「刚才也说了，这是我的作战。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以，我只能拜托你能够帮我。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「但这不都是为了我计划的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想这么做。只是这样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「…知道了。我会竭尽全力的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「快点！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"传来了主将的怒吼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，已经好了。捕手换人。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啥啊！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原一副不能接受的模样冲了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你要换我？为什么！？Why！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你很棒。虽然很厉害，但跟智代合不来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「为什么啊。我的指挥可是万无一失的哦？只是那家伙是个高射炮而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，没错…但是你的指挥，实在是太过于天才了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「太过于天才了，所以智代说没办法跟上你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那样的天才，还是去接职业投手的球吧！刚才就这样向我发火…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嘿…是吗…那样的话也没办法了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「所以我的使命就到此为止了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊，好好休息吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「噢，之后就交给你了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接过了捕手手套之后，我走向了本垒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「护具也借我一套吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「好吧，不过快点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"戴上了护具之后，蹲在了本垒板之后，举起了手套。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",323],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「开球！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"暂停结束。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「准备了，朋也。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，来吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代高高举起了双手…投出。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"清脆的声音过来，球转瞬之间就飞入了我的手套之中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「唉…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"主将一脸讶然的样子，回头望着裁判。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"简直就是像在询问，球已经过来了么的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「好球！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"裁判回答到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「很好，状态不错哦，智代！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当我想要把球丢回去的时候，球落在了地面之上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然，肩膀没有半点力气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到了我的样子后智代跑了过来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么了，朋也？受伤了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，没事的。不用担心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"站起来捡起了球后，塞进了智代的手套里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「继续投刚才那样的球。听好了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「好…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"点了点头后，回到了投球区上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也回到了自己的位置，等着第二球的到来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代的眼神中出现了迷茫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「尽全力投过来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于高高举起了双手…投出。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但全力集中的，只有准备姿势而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…在球投出的一刹那，从指尖滑落出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（…变速球！？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「…哼。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哼了一声后的全力挥棒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"宛如是破空一般的球棒，准确地打在了高高抛过来的球上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咣ーー！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又高又远的大飞球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"甚至都让人懒得去看飞到了哪。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg030y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊ー！为什么连我都得一起捡球不可啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「闭上嘴快去。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":781,"condition":["&&",["&&",["==",["v","f",128],1],["==",["v","g",22],1]],["==",["v","g",45],1]]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30"]},{"op":"native","call":["call","global.counter[].start_real",[],["v","counter",7]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",600],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":767,"condition":["<=",["-",920,300],0]},{"op":"set","target":["v","cur_call.l",1],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":768},{"op":"set","target":["v","cur_call.l",1],"value":300},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",600],"value":920},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",601],"value":["call","global.counter[].get",[],["v","counter",7]]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":772,"condition":["==",0,0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「风子也来帮忙。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，谢了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「对不起，两位…还有这位不知名的女生。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「不用。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"goto","to":784},{"op":"ifFalse","to":784,"condition":["||",["||",["==",["v","f",128],0],["==",["v","g",22],0]],["==",["v","g",45],0]]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「对不起，两位…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说了吧？我只是自己想做才来的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要道歉的话，应该是我才对。拖着你真是抱歉了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不…你是为了我才做的…我很开心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，刚才我也很开心，所以就这样吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，偶尔这样的也不错呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这算哪门子不错了啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你给我闭嘴。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"直到太阳下山为止，我们都在为棒球部打杂，一直捡着满操场的棒球。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",222],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":7},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"bg021"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之后，投票日来临。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"投票是在班会里，由每个班级各自举行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是在选票上罗列的名字里画个圈交上去就行了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在智代的名字上画了一个圈。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":2508,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":967},{"op":"ifFalse","to":967,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「抱歉，智代…我的肩膀没办法发力。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「唉？是受了伤吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「很早以前的事了。在那之后，就再也抬不起来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是吗…抱歉。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那，这样如何？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「朝春原的脸面上丢过去就是了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「想象自己要把春原给砸飞的样子。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「好麻烦呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我也知道那家伙的运动神经很好。这样是很难击中他的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「最后肯定会被手套接住…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不是说真的要把他干掉。只是说，用那样的感觉来投球。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不要去想手套了。只要看着春原那可憎的脸就行了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「真的行得通吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「试试看就知道了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「既然朋也这么说的话，没办法…试试看吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拍了拍智代的肩膀，离开场内。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代则回到了投球区。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「打比赛的时候谈什么情说什么爱啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚才那句话，让智代抓狂了…。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",323],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「有意思…我就当你一次对手好了，春原。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不，对手是这边的人啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不，是你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「准备了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代开始准备投球。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，来吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"高举过头顶后…投球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"春原「咕噗！」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原整个人飞了出去。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗通！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"扬起了一片尘土后，落在了地面上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸦雀无声的操场。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所有人都目瞪口呆了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「裁判，刚才的是好球吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「唉，啊…好，好球！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话音落下后，所有的部员一齐躁动起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我也同样的，只想高声喝彩一番。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（刚才那是怎么回事？快得简直不正常啊…？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以后会成长成一个恐怖的人吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，应该说现在就已经够恐怖了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「下一球，继续。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「那个，捕手失去意识了怎么办。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你把他架着举起来。至少还能当盾牌用吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「但，但这也…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「别废话了照做，可恶。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「是，是！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「准备。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二球也高举过头顶后…投球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻！"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"春原「咕噗！」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好球呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「好球！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第三球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻！"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"春原「咕噗！」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好球呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「好球！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"谷口","text":"「击球手，三振出局！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「抓紧时间，快叫下一个来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"瞠目结舌的主将一动不动。发不出一句话。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「喂，那边的家伙，就你好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而智代也就代替他下令，让击球手站了上来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好球呢。好了，三振。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，一瞬就结束了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「比赛结束。智代的胜利。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",310],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「呼…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么说呢，感觉傻事干着干着也就变得认真起来了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，最近的忧郁一扫而空了。所以也就算了吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原鼻青脸肿地瘫在地面上一动不动。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我…努力当一名…好捕手了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那是梦话。别在意。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「你的名字是叫什么来着。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"主将突然插进了我和智代之间。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「坂上。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「所以名字是叫智代吗？刚才他都这么称呼你的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「啊，没错…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「很好，智代君。今天起就让我们一起向甲子园努力吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这家伙可是女的哦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「化妆假扮一下总有办法的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「啊，弱到不行的我们棒球部总算有一线光明了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「抱歉，还是请你们继续弱下去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"主将","text":"「别这么说嘛！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我最讨厌的就是这种情况。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也，你自己来解决。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，目的还是达成了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「目的？这个有什么目的的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这些家伙之后肯定会为你投上一票的。你看主将都这样子了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是这么一回事吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也你之前都在一个人想这种事情吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别在意。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「具体去做的，还是你自己。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我只是在一旁看着而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「谢谢你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，听好了你们。智代现在正准备竞选学生会长。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「给我好好记住了！」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":2507,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]